the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tWdbqODXdAkQ7kNvwEsIAj7&_nc_oc=Adqmj79v2XlUbZt6JcGRb4bnAg7ytnPrcov2ZVF_Ach_NqzelDqMGKpYbgWy9ANovCw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEWkYQgR4H4a6agl6p0xEl-_i_d8RHjhtfmLWhmCKge2w&oe=6A972643"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z7R_61MxevUQ7kNvwEAB2XV&_nc_oc=AdrwCxygOBby2F7cT9E90e_DK5LDBjdXO43-2zvNY6DaACeDHWwMshARr7zgB1pwAOI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF_DUVv1NinTg2Ftrvv792lX4zGnjxjSHTaor2EU_sXFw&oe=6A971E98"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tS9MgniIxkgQ7kNvwFdGKE4&_nc_oc=AdqCaFnHRSqu2_EzPqgcUpKSwKQfjpbsVl3hsDunAiSEYzuAa2qtrFG-MsQU0O-BjAg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHC1F6MoDimkHTvSRYYswXG6wevfcl24SVuZ_Jd-u4Mjw&oe=6A9731BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080